      {
        "body": "Real dictation path at normal recovers 7 of 12 missed terms (10/15) vs the benchmark's 8 of 12 (11/15): the session's 400 ms trailing pad moves target-hyprland-1 from margin +0.10 to -0.76 nats, reproduced in two daemon runs. R2 as written (on the benchmark) is met; the benchmark does not feed clips the way dictation does. Filed .flow/memory/bug/runtime-errors/parakeet-dictation-user-gets-fewer-2026-11-01.md (surface: crates/dettivo-qa/src/bench/vocabulary_run.rs)",
