      {
        "body": "At vocabulary_boost strong (6.0) a dictated possessive of a term loses its s: \"Hyper land's config is short.\" inserts \"Hyprland config is short.\" (twice through the daemon; engine margin +1.42 padded). normal and off keep \"Hyperlans config is short.\" (margin -2.58). Parakeet hears the possessive as \"Hyperlans\", which the term-plus-s rule does not catch; the old strong (5.0) did not replace it. Paths, URLs, email, case, plural and short terms all held at strong. Filed .flow/memory/bug/runtime-errors/parakeet-user-at-strong-loses-the-2026-11-02.md (surface: crates/dettivo-engine-parakeet (vocabulary rescoring))",
